==Description==
'''Lord Exo''' is the narrator for the [[Halloween 2025 Live Events]] and [[Blind Faith]].

==Appearance==
'''Lord Exo''' had no actual appearance. The area in which a speaker is shown would instead always be empty.

==Trivia==
*Although classified as an animated [[Narrators|narrator]], '''Lord Exo''' by all practical means is not animated at all.

